{title: I call Him Jesus my rock}

{comment: Chorus}
I call Him Jesus my rock, Jesus my rock
Jesus my rock, Lord Jesus my rock
Jesus, Jesus, Jesus, Jesus
I call Him Jesus my rock

{comment: Verse 1}
He’s my rock, my sword, my shield,
He’s the wheel in the middle of the wheel
He’s the Lilly of the valley,
The bright and morning star
Makes no difference what they say,
I’m going down on my knees to pray
I’m going to wait, wait right here until He comes
